<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.description_list.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>DescriptionList 是 gpui-component 描述列表组件的 RML 封装，用于呈现键值对形式的只读信息（如用户详情、产品属性）。</p>
            <p>核心特性：默认 horizontal 布局，vertical 控制纵向；bordered 边框控制；columns 多列布局；label-width 标签列宽；items 绑定批量数据；description 子项支持 label 必填 + value/span 属性；separator 分隔符；value 支持文本属性、文本子节点、元素子节点三种形式。</p>
            <p>支持大小写两种标签形式：DescriptionList/descriptions、DescriptionItem/description、separator（仅小写，避免与独立 Separator 组件冲突）。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <div class="api-table">
                <div class="api-row api-header"><span class="api-prop-name">属性</span><span class="api-prop-type">类型</span><span>说明</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">vertical</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔/绑定</span><span>纵向布局（默认横向）</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">bordered</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔标志</span><span>显示边框</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">columns</span><span class="api-prop-type">数字</span><span>列数</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">label-width</span><span class="api-prop-type">像素值</span><span>标签列宽</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">items</span><span class="api-prop-type">绑定</span><span>批量数据绑定（Vec&lt;DescriptionItem&gt;）</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">description label</span><span class="api-prop-type">字符串</span><span>子项标签（必填）</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">description value</span><span class="api-prop-type">字符串/元素</span><span>子项值</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">description span</span><span class="api-prop-type">数字</span><span>跨列数</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">separator</span><span class="api-prop-type">无属性</span><span>分隔符</span></div>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <div class="code-block">{code_sample}</div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="演示效果">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>1. 水平布局 + bordered + columns={3}</h3>
                <DescriptionList bordered="" columns="3" label-width="120">
                    <DescriptionItem label="用户名" value="alice" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="邮箱" value="alice@example.com" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="手机号" value="13800138000" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="角色" value="管理员" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="状态" value="活跃" span="2" />
                </DescriptionList>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>2. 垂直布局</h3>
                <DescriptionList vertical="" bordered="">
                    <DescriptionItem label="姓名" value="张三" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="年龄" value="28" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="邮箱" value="zhangsan@example.com" />
                </DescriptionList>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>3. 小写标签形式 + separator</h3>
                <descriptions bordered="" columns="2">
                    <description label="产品名称" value="RML 框架" />
                    <description label="版本" value="1.0.0" />
                    <separator />
                    <description label="作者" value="Rust 社区" />
                    <description label="许可证" value="MIT" />
                </descriptions>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>4. bind 绑定（动态数据）</h3>
                <DescriptionList bordered="" columns="2" label-width={width}>
                    <DescriptionItem label="用户名" value={user_name} />
                    <DescriptionItem label="邮箱" value={user_email} />
                    <DescriptionItem label="角色" value={role} span="2" />
                </DescriptionList>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>5. 元素子节点作为 value</h3>
                <DescriptionList bordered="" columns="2">
                    <DescriptionItem label="角色">
                        <Badge primary="">{role}</Badge>
                    </DescriptionItem>
                    <DescriptionItem label="状态">
                        <Badge success="">活跃</Badge>
                    </DescriptionItem>
                </DescriptionList>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>6. items 绑定（批量数据）</h3>
                <p>items={desitems} 从 ViewModel 绑定 Vec&lt;DescriptionItem&gt;，与 inline 子元素共存：</p>
                <descriptions items={desitems} bordered="" columns="2" label-width="100" />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>7. vertical 绑定（动态方向）</h3>
                <p>vertical={is_vertical} 通过 ViewModel 布尔字段控制布局方向：</p>
                <DescriptionList vertical={is_vertical} bordered="" columns="2" label-width="100">
                    <DescriptionItem label="字段 A" value="值 A" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="字段 B" value="值 B" />
                    <DescriptionItem label="字段 C" value="值 C" />
                </DescriptionList>
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
